#: ../../chapter03.rst:362
msgid ""
"To access the user manager, you can click the number of users on "
"Dashboard, or click the \"Users\" on left side menu."
msgstr "要访问用户管理器，您可以点击仪表板上的用户数量，或点击左侧菜单的“用户”。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:364
msgid ""
"In the Documentation, the regular user is often referenced as \"Team "
"User\"."
msgstr "在文档中，常规用户通常被引用为“团队用户”。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:366
msgid ""
"These are the users that have full privilege of home directory, sharing "
"and other features."
msgstr "这些用户拥有家目录、共享和其他功能的全部权限。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:368
msgid "User Manager also have a list view:"
msgstr "用户管理器也有一个列表视图："

#: ../../chapter03.rst:374
msgid "USER MANAGER LIST/ICON VIEW TOGGLE"
msgstr "用户管理器列表/图标视图切换"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:376
msgid ""
"If you have Active Directory, normally these are the users in the Active "
"Directory."
msgstr "如果您有活动目录，通常这些是活动目录中的用户。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:378
msgid "Native User"
msgstr "本地用户"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:380
msgid "These are the users that are created manually with an email."
msgstr "这些是通过电子邮件手动创建的用户。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:382
msgid "AD User"
msgstr "AD 用户"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:384
msgid "These are the users that are imported from Active Directory via LDAP."
msgstr "这些是通过LDAP从活动目录中导入的用户。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:386
msgid "Proxied AD User"
msgstr "代理 AD 用户"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:388
msgid ""
"These are the users that are imported from Server Agent, where the file "
"server agent is remote and away from the Cluster Server in the customer's"
" site. The customer's Active Directory domain is also remote, and the "
"file server itself (where server agent is installed) is in the remote "
"Active Directory."
msgstr "这些是从服务器代理导入的用户，其中文件服务器代理是远程的，并且远离客户现场的集群服务器。客户的活动目录域也是远程的，而文件服务器本身（安装了服务器代理的地方）位于远程活动目录中。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:391
msgid "**User's File and Folder List**"
msgstr "**用户的文件和文件夹列表**"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:396
msgid "VIEWING A USER'S FILE AND FOLDER LIST"
msgstr "查看用户的文件和文件夹列表"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:398
msgid ""
"An admin can view a user's file and folder list using the drive icon "
"**(3)** for the user in Management Console\\User Manager."
msgstr "管理员可以通过管理控制台\用户管理器中用户的驱动器图标 **(3)** 来查看用户的文件和文件夹列表。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:400
msgid ""
"First switch the icon view **(1)** to detail view **(2)** and click the "
"drive icon **(3)** next to the user you are examining. This will open a "
"new window **(4)** where you can view the files."
msgstr "首先将图标视图 **(1)** 切换到详细视图 **(2)**，然后点击正在检查的用户旁的驱动器图标 **(3)**。这将打开一个新窗口 **(4)**，您可以在其中查看文件。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:404 ../../chapter03.rst:1021
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "访客用户"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:405
msgid "``Tenant Dashboard`` > ``Guest Users`` > ``Guest User Manager``"
msgstr "``租户仪表板`` > ``来宾用户`` > ``来宾用户管理器``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:410
msgid "TENANT ADMIN > GUEST USER MANAGER"
msgstr "租户管理员 > 访客用户管理器"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:412
msgid ""
"Guest users are users that don't have a home directory. The only folder "
"they have is “Files Shared with Me”. So they rely on other “Regular User”"
" sharing files and folders with them before they can do anything. If "
"nobody is sharing anything with a guest user, the guest user doesn't have"
" any read/write permission to any folder."
msgstr "访客用户是没有主目录的用户。他们唯一拥有的文件夹是“与我共享的文件”。因此，他们依赖其他“普通用户”与他们共享文件和文件夹，之后他们才能进行任何操作。如果没有人与访客用户共享任何东西，访客用户对任何文件夹都没有读/写权限。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:414
msgid ""
"The primary reason for guest user to exist is to have a secure way for "
"external user to collaborate and edit documents."
msgstr "访客用户存在的主要原因是为了让外部用户有一个安全的方式来协作和编辑文档。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:418
msgid "Group Manager"
msgstr "群组管理器"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:419
msgid "``Tenant Dashboard`` > ``Groups`` > ``Group Manager``"
msgstr "``租户仪表板`` > ``群组`` > ``群组管理器``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:424
msgid "TENANT ADMIN > GROUP MANAGER"
msgstr "租户管理员 > 群组管理器"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:426
msgid ""
"When you have Active Directory integration, you will leverage the Active "
"Directory group instead of using Group Manager here. This group manager "
"is to create a group of users in a simple way. It is not as complicated "
"as Active Directory (such as supporting nested groups) but make it easy "
"for non-Active Directory users. This is native Cluster group. In the "
"product, you may also see AD group from the user selection user interface"
" and Proxied AD group from the user related interface. The AD group and "
"the proxied AD group are not the same as the group mentioned here."
msgstr "当您集成了Active Directory后，您将利用Active Directory群组而不是在这里使用群组管理器。这个群组管理器是为了以简单的方式创建用户群组。它没有Active Directory那样复杂（例如支持嵌套群组），但它使非Active Directory用户的使用变得简单。这是原生的Cluster群组。在产品中，您可能还会从用户选择用户界面看到AD群组，以及从用户相关界面看到代理的AD群组。这里提到的AD群组和代理的AD群组与上文提到的群组不同。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:430
msgid "Role Manager"
msgstr "角色管理器"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:432
msgid "``Tenant Dashboard`` > ``Roles`` > ``Role Manager``"
msgstr "``租户仪表板`` > ``角色`` > ``角色管理器``"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:434
msgid ""
"The Role Manager is to provide role based administration. For example, "
"you may want to provide read-only permissions to some users. You can also"
" assign some group policies to some groups of users. More and more policy"
" items are added to the role manager so in addition to only use role "
"manager for administration, it can be also used to define policy items "
"for users."
msgstr "角色管理器的作用是提供基于角色的管理。例如，您可能希望为某些用户提供只读权限。您还可以为某些用户组分配一些组策略。越来越多的策略项被添加到角色管理器中，因此除了使用角色管理器进行管理外，它还可以用来为用户定义策略项。"

#: ../../chapter03.rst:439
